  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-11-17T03:57:28.146Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I keep recording and streaming with the wrong camera resulting in recording the wrong screen. Is there a way to make the cameras more noticeable or distinctive? Perhaps we can have one of the cameras lighter, a different color, or maybe even display a recording symbol on the top of the camera whenever a person is using the streaming camera.",
